{"id":"b345ddaf3d56d017","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-thresholdselfdualextension.md","title":"A self-dual extension preserves thresholdness","display":"thm-thresholdselfdualextension — A self-dual extension preserves thresholdness","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-thresholdselfdualextension","aliases":["27-thm-thresholdselfdualextension"],"display":"thm-thresholdselfdualextension — A self-dual extension preserves thresholdness","depends_on":["[[27-df-threshold]]","[[27-thm-threshweight]]","[[27-thm-thresholddual]]","[[27-thm-thresholdrestriction]]"],"source_file":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.2 Theorem 9.10","source_printed_pages":"412","source_pdf_pages":"436","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-thresholdselfdualextension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-thresholdselfdualextension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-thresholdselfdualextension — A self-dual extension preserves thresholdness"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c139bcd5f1e41d79\" href=\"?note=c139bcd5f1e41d79\" title=\"27-thm-threshweight\">27-thm-threshweight</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6a307ecf86d39106\" href=\"?note=6a307ecf86d39106\" title=\"27-thm-thresholddual\">27-thm-thresholddual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1557fc2f1143cf1d\" href=\"?note=1557fc2f1143cf1d\" title=\"27-thm-thresholdrestriction\">27-thm-thresholdrestriction</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:/Users/lzy/Documents/BaiduSyncdisk/calibre/Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)/Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.2 Theorem 9.10"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"412"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"436"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb Z_{\\ge0}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}\">\\(y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb B=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>，向量按坐标集上的函数图表示。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Threshold}_n,\\mathrm{Sep}\">\\(\\mathrm{Threshold}_n,\\mathrm{Sep}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d0db491e5f6359f5\" href=\"?note=d0db491e5f6359f5\" title=\"27-df-threshold\">27-df-threshold</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^d:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(f^d:\\mathbb B^n\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb B\">\\(H:\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\to\\mathbb B\\)</span> 由下式构造。整数表示存在性、对偶结构与限制结构分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c139bcd5f1e41d79\" href=\"?note=c139bcd5f1e41d79\" title=\"27-thm-threshweight\">27-thm-threshweight</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"6a307ecf86d39106\" href=\"?note=6a307ecf86d39106\" title=\"27-thm-thresholddual\">27-thm-thresholddual</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1557fc2f1143cf1d\" href=\"?note=1557fc2f1143cf1d\" title=\"27-thm-thresholdrestriction\">27-thm-thresholdrestriction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f^d\\coloneqq\\{(a,1-f((1-a_j)_{j\\in[n]}))\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f^d\\coloneqq\\{(a,1-f((1-a_j)_{j\\in[n]}))\\mid a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,((1-y_{n+1})\\wedge f(y|_{[n]}))\\vee(y_{n+1}\\wedge f^d(y|_{[n]}))\\right)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H\\coloneqq\\left\\{\\left(y,((1-y_{n+1})\\wedge f(y|_{[n]}))\\vee(y_{n+1}\\wedge f^d(y|_{[n]}))\\right)\\mid y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\;H(y)=1-H((1-y_j)_{j\\in[n+1]}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall y\\in\\mathbb B^{n+1}\\;H(y)=1-H((1-y_j)_{j\\in[n+1]}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\Longleftrightarrow H\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_{n+1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[f\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_n\\Longleftrightarrow H\\in\\mathrm{Threshold}_{n+1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\cap(\\mathbb Z^n\\times\\mathbb Z)\\;\n\\left(\\left(w\\cup\\left\\{\\left(n+1,2t+1-\\sum_{i=1}^n w_i\\right)\\right\\},t\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(H)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall(w,t)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(f)\\cap(\\mathbb Z^n\\times\\mathbb Z)\\;\n\\left(\\left(w\\cup\\left\\{\\left(n+1,2t+1-\\sum_{i=1}^n w_i\\right)\\right\\},t\\right)\\in\\mathrm{Sep}(H)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 9.10，印刷 p.412／PDF p.436。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=0\">\\(z=0\\)</span> 层保留原结构，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=1\">\\(z=1\\)</span> 层阈值为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sum w_i-t-1\">\\(\\sum w_i-t-1\\)</span>，恰是整数对偶结构；整数表示存在性来自本书 Theorem 9.5。反向限制 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z=0\">\\(z=0\\)</span>。互补输入交换两层，直接证明自对偶。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-threshold]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-threshweight","status":"resolved","id":"c139bcd5f1e41d79","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-threshweight]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-thresholddual","status":"resolved","id":"6a307ecf86d39106","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholddual]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-thm-thresholdrestriction","status":"resolved","id":"1557fc2f1143cf1d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-thm-thresholdrestriction]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-threshold","status":"resolved","id":"d0db491e5f6359f5","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","ex